'''Dark Step''' (formerly known as '''Black Leg''') is a leg-based [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in the [[First Sea]] (or any other seas).

'''Dark Step''' is the cheapest fighting style that can be purchased, having 4 abilities instead of the usual 3. It allows the user to fight using their legs. This fighting style has the ability for player to Overheat for a short period of time, making them deal more damage.

The abilities on '''Dark Step''' require low [[Mastery]], so this fighting style is beginner friendly. This is also good for the [[First Sea]] if the player can't afford [[Water Kung Fu]] or [[Electric]].

==Obtainment==
Dark Step can be learned for {{Money|150,000}} from the [[Dark Step Teacher]].

==Mastery==
* '''300+ Mastery:''' Dark Step is one of the requirements to obtain [[Superhuman]] in [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]].
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Dark Step is one of the requirements to obtain [[Death Step]] in [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]].

